      "Abdominal pain, left lower quadrant",
      "Nausea with vomiting",
      "Diarrhea",
      "Other chest pain",
      "Acute kidney failure, unspecified",
      "Hemorrhage of rectum and anus",
      "Dysuria",
      "Urinary frequency",
      "Unspecified essential hypertension",
      "Pure hypercholesterolemia",
